{"id": 10091685, "reference": "A12/02903/24", "publication_date": "2024-10-17T07:28:58.960Z", "modification_date": "2024-10-17T07:28:58.963Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "TOYS", "product_name": "Toy robot ", "product_name_specific": "Robot Mechanics", "risk_description": "The plastic material of the cable has an excessive concentrations of bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP), dibutyl phthalate (DBP), short chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCPs) and lead (measured value up to: 1.5%, 0.92%, 3.9% and 0.24% by weight, respectively). \nThe solders in the product have an excessive concentration of lead (measured value up to: 63.6% by weight). \nDEHP and DBP pose a risk to human health and the environment. \nSCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bio-accumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment. Prolonged exposure to them through the skin may cause cancer.\nLead poses a risk to the environment.\n", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the requirements of the Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS Directive) nor with the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POP) Regulation.", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Same Win"], "model_types": ["P16876-1"], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10931020, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10931021, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10931022, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10931023, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}